\par\par \b \uc2  Australian Dlr At 12-Year Low Late; Tracking Yen's Fall \b0\par\par\uc2 283 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Juni 1998\par 09:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The Australian dollar brushed aside \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to plunge to is lowest level against the U.S. dollar in almost 12 years during Asian trading on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Traders estimated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent as much as US$250 million on Monday, on top of the US$2 billion it is estimated to have thrown at the market last week in an attempt to check the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's slide. \par \par \uc2  But neither the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , nor relatively thin liquidity caused by the closure of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's financial markets for Monday's holiday helped to shore up the sagging \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  As the yen fell to its lowest level in nearly seven years, with the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  breaching the long-awaited Y140 barrier, the Australian dollar broke decisively down through the $0.6000 level last seen in July 1986. \par \par \uc2  "If the central bankers are in the office on a public holiday, then you know the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  must be in a full-blown crisis," said the senior trader at a U.S. investment bank in Singapore, predicting that the Australian dollar will trade lower still against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "As long as the (U.S.) dollar remains above Y140, there is a good chance the Aussie will stay below $0.60," said the chief dealer at an Australian bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par At 0720 GMT (3:20 a.m. EDT) the Australian dollar is quoted at\par $0.5975, up a little from its earlier intraday low of $0.5957, but well\par below US$0.6057 late on Friday.\par  -\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-06-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0731GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1054 22766 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du6804wuc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
