\par\par \b \uc2  Australian Bond Prices/Early -2: Yield Curve Flattens \b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juni 1998\par 00:51\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    SYDNEY (Dow Jones)--Australian bond prices are sharply\par lower and the yield curve is markedly flatter early Tuesday\par after heavy selling, which has so far been focused on\par three-year bond futures.\par    A bond salesman at a U.S. investment bank said prices\par fell as market participants factored in a drop in the value\par of the Australian dollar after the local market closed Friday\par and during Monday.\par    The local bond market was closed Monday due to a public\par holiday.\par    The Australian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  hit a new 12-year low of\par US$0.5954 overnight despite rumored Reserve Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Australia\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  early Monday.\par    The weak \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has prompted some analysts to forecast\par the possibility of an interest-rate rise by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par after the heavy \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to support the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which\par began late last week, has so far failed to support the\par Australian dollar.\par    It's those fears of a rate rise that have prompted the\par early bond market selling, the salesman said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    On the Sydney Futures Exchange, the June three-year bond\par futures contract was trading at 94.64, down from 94.82\par Friday, and the June 10-year contract was changing hands at\par 94.460, down from 94.500 locally Friday.\par    The September bank bills contract was trading at 94.52,\par down from 94.80.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  06-08-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1851EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1078 22765 4109 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du6801fba\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
