s, up from the Monday close of 8.5700. Against the Chilean peso, it rose to 454.00 pesos from 453.05 pesos. Weakening copper prices and a wider-than-expected trade deficit weighed on the Chilean peso, traders said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 19-05-98 \par \par \uc2  2132GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5j04azc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
