\par\par \b \uc2  Australian Dlr Sold As Asian Proxy; More  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Mai 1998\par 02:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SYDNEY (Dow Jones)--The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to continue supporting the Australian dollar as long as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is used as a proxy for Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , ignoring relatively positive Australian fundamentals, analysts say. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped into the market through Australian brokers early Tuesday, buying Australian dollars at US$0.6200 and US$0.6250/US$0.6260, according to traders, after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  slipped overnight to a new near 12-year low of US$0.6173. \par \par \uc2  The Reserve Bank took the unusual step of confirming its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . "The reports of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  are correct," said a spokesman for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But the spokesman declined to confirm the levels at which the Reserve Bank bought Australian dollars or the amount purchased. \par \par \uc2  "Over the past week, the Aussie dollar has underperformed some of the Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...which suggests that the Aussie is being used as a proxy rather than being sold on the back of any particular deterioration in its own fundamentals," said Deutsche Morgan Grenfell Australia Ltd. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst Tim Moloney. \par \par \uc2  "The Reserve Bank is quite legitimate in asking the market if it wants to pursue that line of selling," he said. \par \par \uc2  Moloney said the reasons for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  are similar to those in January. \par \par \uc2  The Reserve Bank purchased A$100.0 million in January in a highly public action to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which had fallen to a low of US$0.6315 amid extreme pessimism surrounding Asia's prospects. \par \par \uc2  "You had a situation where momentum on the downside was accelerating," Moloney said. "It did what it did in January - it put a sandbag in front of it." \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 19-05-98 \par \par \uc2  0032GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5j047g2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
