\par\par \b \uc2  WRAP: Australian Docks Row Hurts A$, Might Spur Inflation \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 April 1998\par 13:08\par \uc2  Dow Jones Australia and New Zealand Report \par \uc2 DJAN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  MELBOURNE (Dow Jones)--As the Australian waterfront dispute intensified Monday with labor unionists vowing to ignore a court order to clear pickets at the Port of Melbourne, economists warned the dispute is undermining the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and will likely cause inflationary pressures. \par \par \uc2  There is even speculation the dispute might prompt the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0950 GMT the Australian dollar was trading at US$0.6460, down from US$0.6535 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is under pressure, and bearing in mind that the dock dispute is a transitory thing....(RBA \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) could be a smart thing to do,' Bankers Trust \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Ltd.'s chief economist Chris Caton told Dow Jones. \par \par \uc2  Caton said the US$0.6300 mark is a significant level for the market, with some traders warning that 'there's only daylight' below there. But the speed of any fall in the Australian dollar would also be a factor in any decision by the RBA on when to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , if at all. \par \par \uc2  Unionists have been blockading port terminals operated by stevedoring company Patrick Stevedore Holdings Pty. Ltd. since last week after the company laid off its entire 1,400 strong unionized work force and hired non-union labor in its stead. \par \par \uc2  A Federal Court ruling on an application from the dock workers' union to reinstate the dock workers is expected to be handed down Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 20-04-98 \par \par \uc2  1108GMT \par \par \uc2  1145 4204 \par \par \uc2 Dokument djan000020010916du4k001pj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
