\par\par \b \uc2  Australian Dlr Higher Early But Mkt Nervous, Watching Asia \b0\par\par\uc2 314 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Januar 1998\par 22:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SYDNEY (Dow Jones)--The Australian dollar is marginally higher early Friday but remains stuck in a range between US$0.6550 and US$0.6630, traders said. \par \par \uc2  At 2121 GMT, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was quoted at US$0.6595, up marginally from US$0.6584 late Thursday. It was also at Y83.90, up from Y83.70 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Renewed fears about the fallout from Asia has seen the Australian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  lag gains in the yen over the past day or so. Traders said market participants' focus Friday will be firmly centered on developments in Asia and in particular moves in the Indonesian rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  slid Thursday to a low of IDR16,500 before \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  brought the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  off its lows. \par \par \uc2  Deutsche Morgan Grenfell \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Ltd. senior \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader Ray Monaghan noted that the Australian dollar Thursday failed to benefit from a firmer gold price or a pick up in the value of the yen. Previously, the Australian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has moved in line with shifts in the yen's value. He added that resistance at US$0.6680, which has been tested twice, is also holding the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  back. \par \par \uc2  'Instability in the region is ongoing and the Aussie is being affected by that,' said another trader at an Australian bank. \par \par \uc2  Traders said market activity would ordinarily be quiet Friday ahead of a three-day holiday weekend in Australia. But the second trader said, given the nervousness surrounding Asia, trading in the Australian dollar is likely to be more active. \par \par \uc2  The Bureau of Statistics is scheduled to release quarterly price indices on imports, exports and manufacturing inputs at 0030 GMT. The data aren't expected to affect the level of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  -By Iain McDonald;61-2-9290-8828;imcdonald@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 22-01-98 \par \par \uc2  2127GMT \par \par \uc2  1054 22766 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du1m00lvt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
