\par\par \b \uc2  Australian Dlr Higher Midday On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Reports \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Januar 1998\par 02:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones Australia and New Zealand Report \par \uc2 DJAN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  SYDNEY (Dow Jones)--The Australian dollar is stronger at midsession Friday, although off its morning peak, after reports that the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to buy Australian dollars sent the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  scurrying higher. \par \par \uc2  According to dealers, a reasonably large amount of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was bought by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  near its lows Friday. In response, the Australian dollar rallied sharply from an 11-year low at US$0.6315 touched just ahead of the reported \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buying, to a US$0.6432 late-morning peak. \par \par \uc2  However, the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has since drifted down from its morning highs and at 0110 GMT, is quoted at US$0.6389. This is still up from US$0.6370 locally late Thursday. It also is at Y84.54, above Y84.31 Thursday, while the trade-weighted index has climbed to 60.0 from 59.4. \par \par \uc2  According to one domestic bank dealer the market remains 'volatile,' while traders ponder 'whether these are better levels to sell at, or whether this (Friday's rally) is the start of something to come.' \par \par \uc2  However, the dealer suggests that the Australian dollar might struggle to hold its morning gains, given that 'the Asia crisis is still the big issue.' \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Over the local afternoon, the dealer says the first level to watch on\par the downside is support at US$0.6350 and on the topside, resistance\par toward US$0.6420.\par    -By Sandra Muldoon; 612-9290-8871; smuldoon@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 09-01-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0120GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1054 22766 \par \par \uc2 Dokument djan000020010916du190002i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
