\par\par \b \uc2  Australian Dlr Higher Late After Reports Of RBA Buying \b0\par\par\uc2 305 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Januar 1998\par 07:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SYDNEY (Dow Jones)--The Australian dollar was higher late Friday, buoyed by reports that the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to buy the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the reported \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buying triggered the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rally from an 11-year low of US$0.6315 midmorning, to a US$0.6432 session peak. \par \par \uc2  At 0555 GMT, the Australian dollar was quoted at US$0.6403, up from US$0.6370 late in Sydney Thursday. It also was at Y84.35, just above Y84.31 Thursday while the trade-weighted index was steady at 59.4. \par \par \uc2  The Australian dollar has been stuck in a downward trend since March 1997, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peaked at US$0.8003. The pace of losses accelerated during the latter part of 1997 and early in 1998, amid concern about the impact of Asia's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis on the Australian economy. \par \par \uc2  Around 60% of Australia's exports make their way to south-east Asia and Japan, and analysts fear that a slowdown in these economies resulting from the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis, will damp that region's demand for Australian exports. Also, analysts anticipate the Asian crisis will see slower world growth hampering commodity prices, which is significant for a rural-based economy like Australia. \par \par \uc2  The fact that Asia's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  turmoil still overhangs the market saw the Australian dollar retreat from its session high to US$0.6360 early afternoon, according to analysts. \par \par \uc2  But by late afternoon, the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had climbed back to US$0.6420 as the U.S. dollar slumped versus the yen, according to Brenton Aggar, associate director of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at Macquarie Bank Ltd.. \par \par \uc2  -By Sandra Muldoon; 612-9290-8871; smuldoon@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 09-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0624GMT \par \par \uc2  1054 22766 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du19006u7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
