\par\par \b \uc2  Australian Inflation Fear Pushed RBA To Buy A$: Amplifier \b0\par\par\uc2  By Iain McDonald \par \uc2 297 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Januar 1998\par 06:47\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SYDNEY (Dow Jones)--The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Australia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the Australian dollar for the first time since 1993, prompted by fears that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's steady slide against its U.S counterpart will reignite inflation, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  The Australian dollar has lost more than 23% of its value against the U.S. dollar since December 1996, and its decline has gathered speed as economies wither in Asia, an important export market for Australia. \par \par \uc2  Waves of panic, spilling over from selling in the Indonesian rupiah, prompted the Reserve Bank to act Friday, selling U.S. dollars and buying between A$100 and A$200 million in a largely symbolic move to calm the Australian market, analysts and traders said. \par \par \uc2  In the Sydney session mid-morning, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  called a number of banks to check the price of the Australian dollar, just as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was touching a new 11-year low of US$0.6315 at around 9:45 am local time (2245 GMT Thursday). Traders, who declined to be named, said the bank then sold U.S. dollars for Australian dollars at rates between US$0.6320 and US$6340. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  shot higher as word of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  spread through the market. Within five minutes, the Australian dollar had jumped by three quarters of a U.S. cent. Within an hour, it had peaked at US$0.6432, up by more than one U.S. cent from its pre-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  low. \par \par \uc2  Over the rest of the session, the unit fell back to near US$0.6360 before recovering to US$0.6410 by 0525 GMT. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 09-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0547GMT \par \par \uc2  4204 62549 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du19006ri\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
