\par\par \b \uc2  World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -2: Verbal  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Doesn't Cost A Dime \b0\par\par\uc2 294 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 April 1997\par 23:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones Australia and New Zealand Report \par \uc2 DJAN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  While many traders said they would wait for actual \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the yen, not merely strongly worded comments from Japanese officials, market sentiment toward the dollar became a tad less bullish. \par \par \uc2  'The thing that needs to be taken note of is that the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  word has been used for four to five days now by Japanese officials, and that (their remarks) are acknowledged by U.S. officials,' said Bill Nevius, vice-president of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  sales at NatWest Markets in New York. \par \par \uc2  Japan's Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka said early Thursday that the recent movements of the yen against the dollar were 'clearly excessive'. \par \par \uc2  Without elaborating, Mitsuzuka said Japan will deal with \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements at an appropriate time. \par \par \uc2  Around the same time, Eisuke Sakakibara, head of the international finance bureau of the Japanese Finance Ministry, said: 'I don't think the recent movements in the yen are in line with economic fundamentals. They are excessive.' \par \par \uc2  Sakakibara said he was 'concerned' about the yen's recent weakness. Sakakibara said the ministry will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if the yen falls out of line with fundamentals. \par \par \uc2  Within 25 minutes of hitting the newswires, Sakakibara and Mitsuzuka's comments pushed sent the dollar almost a full yen lower, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been highly effective, traders conceded. They said they were left wondering at what levels the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would actually \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , if it all. \par \par \uc2  'I don't think there'll be coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said Brenner at First Bank National Association. 'It's cheaper and more effective to use verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) DOW JONES \b \highlight22\uc2 AUSTRALIA\b0 \highlight\uc2  AND NEW ZEALAND REPORT 10-04-97 \par \par \uc2  2113GMT \par \par \uc2  20714 \par \par \uc2 Dokument djan000020011006dt4a001pq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
